{"server":"cn","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_06_beg","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_06","title":"领主宅邸攻防战","storyCode":"OD-6","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"4490733362647d0fa74a3e21467032a9ae93ce87e24eafa33dc00ac9df228b5d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nobleN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有多久没见面了，我亲爱的妹妹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半年，一年，还是更久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德鲁奇，你袭击领主卫队，攻占领主府邸，这是在谋反！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谋反，哼，呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该知道，皮加尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是老头子那腐朽的脑袋里还想着保护他那些感染的......啊，劣质资产。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位子根本轮不到你坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静点，妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看这个，这些玩具来自一位哥伦比亚的热心赞助商。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"TSW-2号超声波冲击装置，高精尖工业产品，尚未投入实战的实验武器，唯一的缺点是尺寸太大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把它藏在镇子里，可是花了不少时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你从大宅里骗出来，也花了我不少时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我亲爱的妹妹，你那强大的武技起到什么作用了？你坚强的意志又起到什么作用了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再看看这些朋友，这些萨卡兹朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们可不是那些死脑筋的魔族佬，他们同样来自哥伦比亚，他们为钱办事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道这代表着什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们代表着更先进的东西，是你和老头子永远都不会明白的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要利润够高，金钱能汇聚的力量远超你的想象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老头子坚持的那些狗屁不通的道理，现在又到哪儿去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，我们在一间大房子里找到了这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，巴耶勒王酋的领主委任书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"细纹草纸，绣边签名，砖块一样的巴耶勒文，还有这黝黑盖章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老头子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，我们找遍了所有房间，大宅里只有一大群镇民，没看到你说的老头子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲已经过世了，现在我就是长泉镇的领主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你违抗领主，就是违抗王酋，你已经死罪难逃了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你和那个老东西想出来的计谋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老东西真的是越来越蠢了。你们居然觉得依靠王酋就能将我一军，你真的是天真得可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死罪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老头子引以为豪的瑞柏巴卫队现在就躺在巷子里身首异处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最棘手的领主卫队已经没了，你觉得这里还有谁能管我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这个丧心病狂的废物！他们从小看着你长大！你竟然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不该挡我的道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不该。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在我们血脉相连的份上，我就讲得再直白一点，便于你理解吧，妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，你现在是萨尔贡的领主，没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我呢？我只是一个被家族放逐的流浪汉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但过个几年，等到你不幸亡故，再由我亲自去一趟巴耶勒王廷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我既有血统，又带着矿产和大笔财富向王酋表忠心，你觉得他会不会把长泉镇重新分封给我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再好心地做一个假设，如果你上任没多久就在一场血战中丧生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把你的遗体献给王酋，假若你有幸成为长生军的一员，我会不会因此获得更多好处？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德鲁奇，你这个卑鄙无耻的败类！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么激动，妹妹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，前述内容都只是我的假设，假设不会成真，这只是兄妹谈心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我早就想好了更适合你的去处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到这些身上带石块的东西吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你那么愿意保护感染者，不妨就加入他们吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德鲁奇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你因此而亡的时候，我会找个山洞把你填进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样，你和老头就能看着我是怎么把矿洞底下深藏的源石挖出来，让长泉镇变成整个巴耶勒的矿产中心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，不说话了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在出卖你的家族，出卖这片土地！我诅咒你，德鲁奇，你不得好死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随你开心，我亲爱的妹妹，你想咒多久就咒多久，趁你还有本事说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就这样吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥伦比亚语）你，过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥伦比亚语）老板，你说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥伦比亚语）把那些感染者带到学者那边去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥伦比亚语）好的，我把他们带给科学家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥伦比亚语）这个年轻人呢？看起来快不行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥伦比亚语）是死是活都带过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥伦比亚语）至于我妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥伦比亚语）把她变成感染者，你们萨卡兹人肯定知道怎么弄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥伦比亚语）明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥伦比亚语）不过这可不是合同规定的工作内容，得加钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哥伦比亚语）别那么多废话。往长远看，等我们的事成了，矿山运作起来，有的是钱可分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你可真是有个好哥哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（闭上了眼睛）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（举起武器）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"还有敌人！架盾，保护头儿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_7_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"头儿，还有敌人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"领主卫队的人不是都被干掉了吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看见了！我看见了！那是个......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_7"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"术师，快让怪物动起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"术师雇佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"稍等......我看看......这个要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"动作搞快一点！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！我的肩膀！我的肩膀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要慌乱，敌人在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没......没看到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先撤退，敌人有弓弩，别待在空旷地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"掩护德鲁奇老板，他可不能出事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了！是个菲林！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！撤退！撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你......你是罗德岛的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"你还能动吗，瑞柏巴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"源石畸变体","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"术师雇佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，动起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"术师雇佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她们没有胜算的，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，那老家伙做的玩具也就这时候还有点用处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人和怪物一起上，把她们解决掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"这里敌人太多，我没法保证能让你平安离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的武器在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"你要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德鲁奇能做到这一步都是我的疏忽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有脸面去见长眠的父亲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但就算死，我也要把这叛徒的心挖出来给长泉陪葬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"别冲动，敌人太多，这样行动必死无疑，你需要为这座城镇活下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经给其他人发了信号，他们很快就到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"老板，那些佣兵和罗德岛的人正在攻击我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怕什么，这宅邸固若金汤，就凭几个佣兵又能怎么样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让术师操纵怪物干掉那个菲林。其他人守住入口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬